            </note>
            <note corresp="#d110-f2" n="1" xml:id="d110-f2-content">
                <p>Telegram 4590 from London, March 21, reported on British press reaction to the
                    March 4 endorsement by the Department of State of the latest Hallstein proposals. (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >ibid</hi>., 375.42/3–2160)</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d110-f3" n="2" xml:id="d110-f3-content">
                <p>Telegram 4543 from London, March 17, reported on informal discussions with
                    British officials on procedural aspects of the trade committee meeting of the
                        OEEC nations. (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >ibid</hi>., 398.00-PA/3–1760)</p>
            </note>
